nty runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 the middle saw April to May at 192% of normal and November to December at 30%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 18458 sat at 57% of normal that year.</p>"}
